", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a61976000b3c1de9a673d52860417c9, https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=da1590b2025206a757b5d1cd4f51e42d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8b8c436/uploads/origins/78ef1d15-bf74-4916-b3cb-8a89699584ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f4801ad3fec159a411679659635cbfbc 3x"}, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I was deeply moved when I saw your work, Canari, the other day. Therefore, regarding this request, I would like to ask for Gwynn (Janapese name is ムク) , who also appears in \"Legends: Z-A\". She's petite and adorable, yet carries a hint of eeriness. Then again, that might be natural for a Ghost-type user. I feel she's the perfect fit for your expression. I look forward to seeing your Kawaii illustrations again.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 275133, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694726028b6f3e38f54ca00bc4866374", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694726028b6f3e38f54ca00bc4866374, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21e40949f4b84491cf2ac89f7a288316 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6e4ba8ed66cef7d2913ce5f0c02cabb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0357fdd5d61aa6b7e7a78fd91975e08", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0357fdd5d61aa6b7e7a78fd91975e08, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1f1d973c2f1f297ab588e6876c216cb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cc45c19/uploads/origins/0ca7547f-d048-4f7c-af30-dbc76dfefc79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=979b7dcbd6205860063d062b70a9419a 3x"}, "body": "Hello Kokoro Mingtong Sensei. I love your Kawaii illustrations and am happy to be able to commission you again like this. Now, what I would like to commission you to do is Rosalina from the Super Mario series. She has starry features and I am curious to see how shimmering and beautiful she will be in your works. She has a wide variety of outfits, for example, a biker suit(Mario Kart), an Aurora Dress(Mario Kart Tour), and a Cat Suit(Super Mario 3D World), but we leave it up to you to choose which one you would like to wear. However, if I may venture to tell you, I prefer the Aurora Dress(Mario Kart Tour). I look forward to seeing your more refined work again.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 275133, 