n the Gakuen Idolmaster, for better or worse, she will always leave a strong impression. She has a variety of outfits, I particularly like the Fancy Dress Party outfit, but you can choose whichever outfit you like. I trust your judgement. I look forward to seeing your Kawaii illustrations again.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kokorominton/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 275133, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a85a95758d4affb4597f4fc2196d78ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a85a95758d4affb4597f4fc2196d78ba, https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e8d7f30c866c6277ac2f01f73bcb3fa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6a6deb24fb0f6b532b1f95c9415b355 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=568c1bd4e5f51627eff4fa28c489fd35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=568c1bd4e5f51627eff4fa28c489fd35, https://si.imgix.net/948b029d/uploads/origins/c17065ca-a14e-4289-bcfe-be9b9ffa7997?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=w